---
title: Whiskey sour
category: More
diet:
  - vegetarian
tags:
  - cocktail
  - drink
  - alcoholic
  - whiskey
servings: 1
difficulty: easy
prep time: 2 minutes
created: 2026-07-28
updated: 2026-07-28
---

In a #shaker{}, add @bourbon whiskey{3%parts}, @lemon juice{2%parts}(fresh), @simple syrup{1%part}, and @egg white{}.

Dry-shake for ~{30%seconds} without ice.

Add ice and shake for another ~{20%seconds} until chilled.

Strain into a chilled #old fashioned glass{}, then garnish with @Maraschino cherry{1}, @orange{1/2%slice}, and a splash of @Angostura bitters{}.